# CR 708.9, 104.3a: at the end of the game every face-down permanent and face-down spell is revealed to all players by its
# owner. Bot1 casts Abzan Guide face down (morph) and it resolves, then casts Bolrac-Clan Basher face down (disguise) with
# Black Lotus's mana; Bot2 concedes with it on the stack, which ends the game: Bot1 reveals both, where they are, still face down.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Abzan Guide
Bolrac-Clan Basher
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
